# Frontend

Follow `frontend/AGENTS.md` and the `frontend-deals-ui` skill.

- Use `src/lib/api.ts` for FastAPI
- Use `src/lib/supabase.ts` for Auth/Realtime only
- Render `Deal.score` from the API; do not recompute profit in components
